{"book":"Romans","chapter":7,"translation":"KJV","url":"/bible/romans/7","verses":[{"verse":1,"text":"Know ye not, brethren, (for I speak to them that know the law,) how that the law hath dominion over a man as long as he liveth?","words":[["Know ye not,",["G50"]],["brethren,",["G80"]],["(for",["G1063"]],["I speak",["G2980"]],["to them that know",["G1097"]],["the law,)",["G3551"]],["how that",["G3754"]],["the law",["G3551"]],["hath dominion over",["G2961"]],["a man",["G444"]],["as long as",["G1909","G3745","G5550"]],["he liveth?",[]]]},{"verse":2,"text":"For the woman which hath an husband is bound by the law to her husband so long as he liveth; but if the husband be dead, she is loosed from the law of her husband.","words":[["For",["G1063"]],["the woman",["G1135"]],["which hath an husband",["G5220"]],["is bound",["G1210"]],["by the law",["G3551"]],["to her husband",["G435"]],["so long as he liveth;",["G2198"]],["but",["G1161"]],["if",["G1437"]],["the husband",["G435"]],["be dead,",["G599"]],["she is loosed",["G2673"]],["from",["G575"]],["the law",["G3551"]],["of her husband.",[]]]},{"verse":3,"text":"So then if, while her husband liveth, she be married to another man, she shall be called an adulteress: but if her husband be dead, she is free from that law; so that she is no adulteress, though she be married to another man.","words":[["So then",["G686","G3767"]],["if,",["G1437"]],["while her husband",["G435"]],["liveth,",["G2198"]],["she be married",["G1096"]],["to another",["G2087"]],["man,",["G435"]],["she shall be called",["G5537"]],["an adulteress:",["G3428"]],["but",["G1161"]],["if",["G1437"]],["her husband",["G435"]],["be dead,",["G599"]],["she is",["G2076"]],["free",["G1658"]],["from",["G575"]],["that law;",["G3551"]],["so that she",["G846"]],["is",["G1511"]],["no",["G3361"]],["adulteress,",["G3428"]],["though she be married",["G1096"]],["to another",["G2087"]],["man.",[]]]},{"verse":4,"text":"Wherefore, my brethren, ye also are become dead to the law by the body of Christ; that ye should be married to another, even to him who is raised from the dead, that we should bring forth fruit unto God.","words":[["Wherefore,",["G5620"]],["my",["G3450"]],["brethren,",["G80"]],["ye",["G5210"]],["also",["G2532"]],["are become dead",["G2289"]],["to the law",["G3551"]],["by",["G1223"]],["the body",["G4983"]],["of Christ;",["G5547"]],["that",["G1519"]],["ye",["G5209"]],["should be married",["G1096"]],["to another,",["G2087"]],["even to him who is raised",["G1453"]],["from",["G1537"]],["the dead,",["G3498"]],["that",["G2443"]],["we should bring forth fruit",["G2592"]],["unto God.",[]]]},{"verse":5,"text":"For when we were in the flesh, the motions of sins, which were by the law, did work in our members to bring forth fruit unto death.","words":[["For",["G1063"]],["when",["G3753"]],["we were",["G2258"]],["in",["G1722"]],["the flesh,",["G4561"]],["the motions",["G3804"]],["of sins,",["G266"]],["which",["G3588"]],["were by",["G1223"]],["the law,",["G3551"]],["did work",["G1754"]],["in",["G1722"]],["our",["G2257"]],["members",["G3196"]],["to bring",["G1519"]],["forth fruit",["G2592"]],["unto death.",[]]]},{"verse":6,"text":"But now we are delivered from the law, that being dead wherein we were held; that we should serve in newness of spirit, and not in the oldness of the letter.","words":[["But",["G1161"]],["now",["G3570"]],["we are delivered",["G2673"]],["from",["G575"]],["the law,",["G3551"]],["that being dead",["G599","G599"]],["wherein",["G1722","G3739"]],["we were held;",["G2722"]],["that",["G5620"]],["we",["G2248"]],["should serve",["G1398"]],["in",["G1722"]],["newness",["G2538"]],["of spirit,",["G4151"]],["and",["G2532"]],["not",["G3756"]],["in the oldness",["G3821"]],["of the letter.",[]]]},{"verse":7,"text":"What shall we say then? Is the law sin? God forbid. Nay, I had not known sin, but by the law: for I had not known lust, except the law had said, Thou shalt not covet.","words":[["What",["G5101"]],["shall we say",["G2046"]],["then?",["G3767"]],["Is the law",["G3551"]],["sin?",["G266"]],["God forbid.",["G3361","G1096"]],["Nay,",["G235"]],["I had",["G1097"]],["not",["G3756"]],["known",["G1097"]],["sin,",["G266"]],["but",["G1508"]],["by",["G1223"]],["the law:",["G3551"]],["for",["G1063","G5037"]],["I had",["G1492"]],["not",["G3756"]],["known",["G1492"]],["lust,",["G1939"]],["except",["G1508"]],["the law",["G3551"]],["had said,",["G3004"]],["Thou shalt",["G1937"]],["not",["G3756"]],["covet.",[]]]},{"verse":8,"text":"But sin, taking occasion by the commandment, wrought in me all manner of concupiscence. For without the law sin was dead.","words":[["But",["G1161"]],["sin,",["G266"]],["taking",["G2983"]],["occasion",["G874"]],["by",["G1223"]],["the commandment,",["G1785"]],["wrought",["G2716"]],["in",["G1722"]],["me",["G1698"]],["all manner of",["G3956"]],["concupiscence.",["G1939"]],["For",["G1063"]],["without",["G5565"]],["the law",["G3551"]],["sin",["G266"]],["was dead.",[]]]},{"verse":9,"text":"For I was alive without the law once: but when the commandment came, sin revived, and I died.","words":[["For",["G1161"]],["I",["G1473"]],["was alive",["G2198"]],["without",["G5565"]],["the law",["G3551"]],["once:",["G4218"]],["but",["G1161"]],["when the commandment",["G1785"]],["came,",["G2064"]],["sin",["G266"]],["revived,",["G326"]],["and",["G1161"]],["I",["G1473"]],["died.",[]]]},{"verse":10,"text":"And the commandment, which was ordained to life, I found to be unto death.","words":[["And",["G2532"]],["the commandment,",["G1785"]],["which",["G3588"]],["was ordained to",["G1519"]],["life,",["G2222"]],["I",["G3427"]],["found",["G2147","G3778"]],["to be unto",["G1519"]],["death.",[]]]},{"verse":11,"text":"For sin, taking occasion by the commandment, deceived me, and by it slew me.","words":[["For",["G1063"]],["sin,",["G266"]],["taking",["G2983"]],["occasion",["G874"]],["by",["G1223"]],["the commandment,",["G1785"]],["deceived",["G1818"]],["me,",["G3165"]],["and",["G2532"]],["by",["G1223"]],["it",["G846"]],["slew me.",[]]]},{"verse":12,"text":"Wherefore the law is holy, and the commandment holy, and just, and good.","words":[["Wherefore",["G5620","G3303"]],["the law",["G3551"]],["is holy,",["G40"]],["and",["G2532"]],["the commandment",["G1785"]],["holy,",["G40"]],["and",["G2532"]],["just,",["G1342"]],["and",["G2532"]],["good.",[]]]},{"verse":13,"text":"Was then that which is good made death unto me? God forbid. But sin, that it might appear sin, working death in me by that which is good; that sin by the commandment might become exceeding sinful.","words":[["Was then",["G3767"]],["that which is good",["G18"]],["made",["G1096"]],["death",["G2288"]],["unto me?",["G1698"]],["God forbid.",["G3361","G1096"]],["But",["G235"]],["sin,",["G266"]],["that",["G2443"]],["it might appear",["G5316"]],["sin,",["G266"]],["working",["G2716"]],["death",["G2288"]],["in me",["G3427"]],["by",["G1223"]],["that which is good;",["G18"]],["that",["G2443"]],["sin",["G266"]],["by",["G1223"]],["the commandment",["G1785"]],["might become",["G1096"]],["exceeding",["G2596","G5236"]],["sinful.",[]]]},{"verse":14,"text":"For we know that the law is spiritual: but I am carnal, sold under sin.","words":[["For",["G1063"]],["we know",["G1492"]],["that",["G3754"]],["the law",["G3551"]],["is",["G2076"]],["spiritual:",["G4152"]],["but",["G1161"]],["I",["G1473"]],["am",["G1510"]],["carnal,",["G4559"]],["sold",["G4097"]],["under",["G5259"]],["sin.",[]]]},{"verse":15,"text":"For that which I do I allow not: for what I would, that do I not; but what I hate, that do I.","words":[["For",["G1063"]],["that which",["G3739"]],["I do",["G2716"]],["I allow",["G1097"]],["not:",["G3756"]],["for",["G1063"]],["what",["G3739"]],["I would,",["G2309"]],["that",["G5124"]],["do I",["G4238"]],["not;",["G3756"]],["but",["G235"]],["what",["G3739"]],["I hate,",["G3404"]],["that",["G5124"]],["do I.",[]]]},{"verse":16,"text":"If then I do that which I would not, I consent unto the law that it is good.","words":[["If",["G1487"]],["then",["G1161"]],["I do",["G4160"]],["that",["G5124"]],["which",["G3739"]],["I would",["G2309"]],["not,",["G3756"]],["I consent",["G4852"]],["unto the law",["G3551"]],["that",["G3754"]],["it is good.",[]]]},{"verse":17,"text":"Now then it is no more I that do it, but sin that dwelleth in me.","words":[["Now",["G3570"]],["then",["G1161"]],["it is no more",["G3765"]],["I",["G1473"]],["that do",["G2716"]],["it,",["G846"]],["but",["G235"]],["sin",["G266"]],["that dwelleth",["G3611"]],["in",["G1722"]],["me.",[]]]},{"verse":18,"text":"For I know that in me (that is, in my flesh,) dwelleth no good thing: for to will is present with me; but how to perform that which is good I find not.","words":[["For",["G1063"]],["I know",["G1492"]],["that",["G3754"]],["in",["G1722"]],["me",["G1698"]],["(that is,",["G5123"]],["in",["G1722"]],["my",["G3450"]],["flesh,)",["G4561"]],["dwelleth",["G3611"]],["no",["G3756"]],["good thing:",["G18"]],["for",["G1063"]],["to will",["G2309"]],["is present",["G3873"]],["with me;",["G3427"]],["but",["G1161"]],["how to perform",["G2716"]],["that which is good",["G2570"]],["I find",["G2147"]],["not.",[]]]},{"verse":19,"text":"For the good that I would I do not: but the evil which I would not, that I do.","words":[["For",["G1063","G3739"]],["the good",["G18"]],["that I would",["G2309"]],["I do",["G4160"]],["not:",["G3756"]],["but",["G235"]],["the evil",["G2556"]],["which",["G3739"]],["I would",["G2309"]],["not,",["G3756"]],["that",["G5124"]],["I do.",[]]]},{"verse":20,"text":"Now if I do that I would not, it is no more I that do it, but sin that dwelleth in me.","words":[["Now",["G1161"]],["if",["G1487","G3739"]],["I do",["G4160"]],["that",["G5124"]],["I",["G1473"]],["would",["G2309"]],["not,",["G3756"]],["it is no more",["G2089","G3765"]],["I",["G1473"]],["that do",["G2716"]],["it,",["G846"]],["but",["G235"]],["sin",["G266"]],["that dwelleth",["G3611"]],["in",["G1722"]],["me.",[]]]},{"verse":21,"text":"I find then a law, that, when I would do good, evil is present with me.","words":[["I find",["G2147"]],["then",["G686"]],["a law,",["G3551"]],["that,",["G3754"]],["when I",["G1698"]],["would",["G2309"]],["do",["G4160"]],["good,",["G2570"]],["evil",["G2556"]],["is present",["G3873"]],["with me.",[]]]},{"verse":22,"text":"For I delight in the law of God after the inward man:","words":[["For",["G1063"]],["I delight",["G4913"]],["in the law",["G3551"]],["of God",["G2316"]],["after",["G2596"]],["the inward",["G2080"]],["man:",[]]]},{"verse":23,"text":"But I see another law in my members, warring against the law of my mind, and bringing me into captivity to the law of sin which is in my members.","words":[["But",["G1161"]],["I see",["G991"]],["another",["G2087"]],["law",["G3551"]],["in",["G1722"]],["my",["G3450"]],["members,",["G3196"]],["warring against",["G497"]],["the law",["G3551"]],["of my",["G3450"]],["mind,",["G3563"]],["and",["G2532"]],["bringing",["G163"]],["me",["G3165"]],["into captivity",["G163"]],["to the law",["G3551"]],["of sin",["G266"]],["which",["G3588"]],["is",["G5607"]],["in",["G1722"]],["my",["G3450"]],["members.",[]]]},{"verse":24,"text":"O wretched man that I am! who shall deliver me from the body of this death?","words":[["O wretched",["G5005"]],["man",["G444"]],["that I am!",["G1473"]],["who",["G5101"]],["shall deliver",["G4506"]],["me",["G3165"]],["from",["G1537"]],["the body",["G4983"]],["of this",["G5127"]],["death?",[]]]},{"verse":25,"text":"I thank God through Jesus Christ our Lord. So then with the mind I myself serve the law of God; but with the flesh the law of sin.","words":[["I thank",["G2168"]],["God",["G2316"]],["through",["G1223"]],["Jesus",["G2424"]],["Christ",["G5547"]],["our",["G2257"]],["Lord.",["G2962"]],["So then",["G686","G3767"]],["with the mind",["G3563"]],["I",["G1473"]],["myself",["G846"]],["serve",["G3303","G1398"]],["the law",["G3551"]],["of God;",["G2316"]],["but",["G1161"]],["with the flesh",["G4561"]],["the law",["G3551"]],["of sin.",[]]]}]}